usage: replay.py [-h] --config CONFIG --output OUTPUT [--device DEVICE]
                 [--source {zarr,raw}] [--episodes EPISODES]
                 [--max-frames MAX_FRAMES] [--execute-steps EXECUTE_STEPS]

Offline real-data replay and target recording; never opens camera or DDS.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --output OUTPUT       New output directory
  --device DEVICE       cpu or cuda:N, no fallback
  --source {zarr,raw}
  --episodes EPISODES   Zero-based comma-separated episode indices
  --max-frames MAX_FRAMES
                        Per episode; 0 means entire episode
  --execute-steps EXECUTE_STEPS
                        Replan after 1..15 steps

usage: verify.py [-h] --config CONFIG --output OUTPUT --urdf URDF

Verify formal EMA, original inference, real preprocessing and dataset
boundaries.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG
  --output OUTPUT
  --urdf URDF

PASS: No SDK, camera, teleop, or WandB import or construction
